# Filenames the guide's workflows tell you to create, any CSV export and any orders dump. They hold
# YOUR positions. The underscore-prefixed forms above were covered; these plain ones were not. Placed
# BEFORE the samples re-include so the committed fake CSVs stay tracked.
holdings.json
fills.json
prices.json
weights.json
*.csv
orders*.json

# keep the fakes
!samples/*

# ---- junk ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.playwright-mcp/
*.png
# ...but the README's screenshots are documentation, not junk. The blanket *.png above silently
# excluded them, so every image in the README rendered broken on GitHub.
!docs/img/*.png

# keep the agent skill
!.claude/
!.claude/**
_t/
.vercel
